 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "My Marriage Is With Your Older Brother"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "결혼은 당신 형과"
   },
   {
    "en": "I'll Marry Your Brother"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Yeojin, who once lived a life everyone envied—married to a handsome news anchor and the heir of a wealthy family—was, in reality, trapped in an unhappy marriage. Her husband not only had an affair with her close hoobae but also went as far as stealing her parents' company and even killing them. She thought it was the end, but when she opened her eyes, she found herself back on the day of her wedding. Watching her husband and his mistress brazenly whispering sweet nothings to each other, Yeojin made a decision: she would do whatever it took to exact her revenge, even if it meant marrying her husband’s older brother."
  },
